Bugfix: Do not append the system certificate bundle to itself

Regenerating the system certificate bundle appended the bundle file that was
being rewritten. On local storage the bundled CA certificates ended up in it
twice. On object storage the previous bundle was read back, so root
certificates that an update had removed were still trusted, and the bundle
grew with every regeneration.

https://github.com/owncloud/core/pull/41956
